<%# Shown only when the site is running as a public archive (ARCHIVEMODE).
    Sits above the sticky header so it stays out of the header's own layout.
    The custom property lets the test page work out how much vertical space
    the banner has taken; it falls back to 0px on a normal deployment where
    this partial never renders. %>
<style>:root { --archive-banner-height: 44px; }</style>
<div id="archiveBanner" class="archive-banner" role="note">
    <p class="archive-banner__text">
        <strong>Public archive.</strong>
        Cookies and login are disabled &mdash; this site is illustrative only.
    </p>
</div>
